{"speciesId":740,"names":{"fr":"Crabominable","es":"Crabominable","en":"Crabominable","ja":"ケケンカニ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Il rêvait d’atteindre le sommet d’un pic enneigé, mais s’est égaré en chemin. Il a dû évoluer pour survivre au froid et a acquis un pelage fourni."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Tras perderse intentando coronar una alta montaña, desarrolló una capa de pelo para protegerse del frío."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"It aimed for the top but got lost and ended up on a snowy mountain. Being forced to endure the cold, this Pokémon evolved and grew fur."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"トップを 目指すはずが 雪山に 迷い登り 寒さに 耐えるうちに 毛が 生えてきて 進化していた。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Il distribue les coups de pince au petit bonheur la chance. En dernier recours, il les décroche et les envoie telles des roquettes."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Asesta golpes con las pinzas a diestro y siniestro. Si se ve en apuros, se desprende de ellas lanzándolas como si fueran cohetes."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"It just throws punches indiscriminately. In times of desperation, it can lop off its own pincers and fire them like rockets."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"とにかく 見境なく なぐる。 いざと なったら ハサミを 自切し ロケットのように 発射し なぐる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il concentre le froid dans ses pinces avant de frapper. Ses coups sont suffisamment puissants pour réduire un épais mur de glace en morceaux."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"En el interior de las pinzas acumula aire gélido. Los golpes que asesta son capaces de hacer añicos incluso gruesas paredes de hielo."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It stores coldness in its pincers and pummels its foes. It can even smash thick walls of ice to bits!"},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"ハサミの 中に 冷気を 溜めて ぶん殴る。 分厚い 氷の 壁も 粉々に してしまうぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Agir ou réfléchir ? Crabominable choisit de frapper ! On raconte qu’il serait déjà parvenu à repousser une avalanche à coups de pince."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"No se lo piensa dos veces a la hora de zurrar. Se tiene constancia de que sus puñetazos frenéticos han llegado a detener aludes."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Before it stops to think, it just starts pummeling. There are records of its turning back avalanches with a flurry of punches."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"考えるより まず 殴ってみる。 ゆきなだれを パンチの ラッシュで 押し返したという 記録も ある。"}],"varieties":[{"id":740,"moves":[{"name":"ice-punch","learns":[[17,"level-up",0],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",0],[18,"level-up",1],[18,"tutor",0],[25,"level-up",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"thunder-punch","learns":[[18,"tutor",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"slam","learns":[[25,"level-up",25]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"leer","learns":[[17,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",9],[18,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",9],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"ice-beam","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"blizzard","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"bubble-beam","learns":[[17,"level-up",17],[18,"level-up",17],[25,"level-up",17]]},{"name":"hyper-beam","learns":[[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"earthquake","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"dig","learns":[[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"toxic","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-team","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"swift","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"amnesia","learns":[[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"bubble","learns":[[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"dizzy-punch","learns":